{"id": "EUVD-2026-97597", "enisaUuid": "12d90d7f-fe4f-36b8-937f-58539de9a116", "description": "Open WebUI from 0.11.0 before 0.11.4 contains a regular expression denial of service vulnerability that allows authenticated users to stall server workers via file search patterns. Attackers can instruct the model to call grep_knowledge_files or grep_chat_files with a catastrophically backtracking regex, blocking the event loop for two seconds per repeated call.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:04:54", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T18:09:05", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/security/advisories/GHSA-gfjp-5hc9-852r", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/open-webui-0.11.0-before-0.11.4-redos-via-grep-knowledge-files-event-loop"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109295", "GHSA-9hcw-jmg5-2vcc"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.31, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8d8bf20f-9cab-38a3-af29-8b8c2e6c2600", "product": {"name": "open-webui", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}, "product_version": "0.11.0 <0.11.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c7dba202-b14b-3cee-ba44-0388c3d29483", "vendor": {"name": "open-webui"}}], "isExploited": false}